              (stackRegressors Z r ω))ᵀ *
            controlFunctionDesignStar
              (stackRegressors X₁ r ω) (stackRegressors X₂ r ω)
              (stackRegressors Z r ω)).det)}) =ᶠ[atTop]
      (fun r => μ {ω | ¬ IsUnit (((Dee r ω)ᵀ * Dee r ω).det)}) := by
