/-- Hansen Theorem 12.10 block test, stated with the named homoskedastic Wald
statistic as `W⁰ / q`. -/
theorem generatedRegressorHomoskedasticWaldDiv_hasLaw_classicalFDist
    (W₁ : Matrix n k₁ ℝ) (W₂hat : Matrix n k₂ ℝ) (β₁ : k₁ → ℝ)
